      "source": [
        "## Neo4j/Cypher Adaptation Notes\n",
        "\n",
        "이 노트북은 이제 `networkx` 샘플 그래프가 아니라 Neo4j Sandbox를 직접 조회합니다. 먼저 GitHub Raw CSV를 Neo4j Browser에서 실행해 KG를 올리세요.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 1) Entity CSV 로드\n",
        "\n",
        "스크린샷 기준 컬럼: `entity_id,name,Type,description,source`\n",
        "\n",
        "```cypher\n",
        "CREATE CONSTRAINT entity_id_unique IF NOT EXISTS\n",
        "FOR (e:Entity) REQUIRE e.entity_id IS UNIQUE;\n",
        "\n",
        "LOAD CSV WITH HEADERS FROM 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dongwon0002/SC-csv/main/entity_node_manual/entity_node_manual.csv' AS row\n",
        "MERGE (e:Entity {entity_id: row.entity_id})\n",
        "SET e.name = row.name,\n",
        "    e.Type = row.Type,\n",
        "    e.description = row.description,\n",
        "    e.source = row.source;\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "### 2) Relation CSV 로드\n",
        "\n",
        "스크린샷 기준 컬럼: `relation_id,:START_ID,:END_ID,:TYPE,source_name,target_name,source_type,target_type,source_file,evidence,tier,confidence,notes`\n",
        "\n",
        "```cypher\n",
        "LOAD CSV WITH HEADERS FROM 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dongwon0002/SC-csv/main/kg_relations_full.csv' AS row\n",
        "MATCH (s:Entity {entity_id: row.`:START_ID`})\n",
        "MATCH (t:Entity {entity_id: row.`:END_ID`})\n",
        "MERGE (s)-[r:KG_RELATION {relation_id: row.relation_id}]->(t)\n",
        "SET r.type = row.`:TYPE`,\n",
        "    r.source_name = row.source_name,\n",
        "    r.target_name = row.target_name,\n",
        "    r.source_type = row.source_type,\n",
        "    r.target_type = row.target_type,\n",
        "    r.source_file = row.source_file,\n",
        "    r.evidence = row.evidence,\n",
        "    r.tier = row.tier,\n",
        "    r.confidence = row.confidence,\n",
        "    r.notes = row.notes;\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "### 3) 같은 시작-끝-type 중복 relation 삭제\n",
        "\n",
        "```cypher\n",
        "MATCH (s:Entity)-[r:KG_RELATION]->(t:Entity)\n",
        "WITH s, t, r.type AS rel_type, collect(r) AS rels\n",
        "WHERE size(rels) > 1\n",
        "FOREACH (rel IN tail(rels) | DELETE rel);\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "중복 확인:\n",
        "\n",
        "```cypher\n",
        "MATCH (s:Entity)-[r:KG_RELATION]->(t:Entity)\n",
        "WITH s.entity_id AS start_id, t.entity_id AS end_id, r.type AS rel_type, count(r) AS cnt\n",
        "WHERE cnt > 1\n",
        "RETURN start_id, end_id, rel_type, cnt\n",
        "ORDER BY cnt DESC;\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "### 4) KG Query Agent가 사용하는 탐색 패턴\n",
        "\n",
        "```cypher\n",
        "MATCH p = (focal:Entity)-[:KG_RELATION*1..4]-(n:Entity)\n",
        "WHERE (focal.name = $focal_company OR focal.entity_id = $focal_company)\n",
        "  AND (\n",
        "    n.name IN $disrupted_entities\n",
        "    OR n.entity_id IN $disrupted_entities\n",
        "    OR n.Type IN $disrupted_entities\n",
        "    OR n.description IN $disrupted_entities\n",
        "  )\n",
        "RETURN p\n",
        "LIMIT 200;\n",
        "```\n"
      ]
